    {
      "id": "apprentice_inps_rates_unsourced",
      "institute": "inps_employer",
      "variant": "apprentice",
      "discriminant": "applies_when.trigger = run",
      "rule": "APPRENTICE INPS RATES: the apprentice rates of the sector (artigianato) apply the 10% of L. 296/2006 art. 1 c. 773 plus the 1.61% NASpI, but no source found settles whether the 0.91 NASpI reduction of the artisan employers also applies to apprentices, nor the wage-integration contribution they owe (the FSBA is paid outside INPS). The contributions of an apprentice may differ.",
      "calculation": "ccnl/pulizia-artigianato-confartigianato:coverage.notes",
      "state": "unverified",
      "work": [
        "T04.02"
      ],
      "verification": [
        "T04.12"
      ],
      "origin": "seeded",
      "links": {
        "limitations": [
          "pulizia-artigianato-confartigianato/apprentice_inps_rates_unsourced"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "apprentice_seniority",
      "institute": "seniority",
      "variant": "apprentice",
      "discriminant": "applies_when.trigger = path",
      "rule": "APPRENTICE SENIORITY: the December 2025 renewal extends the seniority increments to apprentices from 2026-01-01 (see the seniority note), but the clause and its amounts are not modelled: the engine pays no increment during the apprenticeship. The run is affected when the apprentice has matured increments the level pays.",
      "calculation": "ccnl/pulizia-artigianato-confartigianato:coverage.notes",
      "state": "absent",
      "work": [
        "T02.03"
      ],
      "verification": [
